    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but talking to them just makes it worse. it just creates more guilt for me and more stress for them. i just keep thinking about how much easier their lives would be if they didn't have to deal with me at all. like, wouldn't it be a more selfless thing to just... stop being a burden?",
